# Keys of infra/secrets/ops.enc.env. Values empty on purpose.
# Real values: `sops infra/secrets/ops.enc.env` (see README.md).
# The Kuma and Beszel admin accounts are made in their UIs, not here.
# OPS_DOMAIN is NOT here: prod nginx reads it from the prod .env (prod.example.env).

# Public key from the Beszel hub ("Add system"). Not secret. Empty on the first run: only
# the agent restarts until it is set (12-operations.md section 1, step 3).
BESZEL_KEY=
